  "types": [
    {
      "name": "CodeBuffer",
      "docs": [
        "CodeBuffer metadata. Holds no bytecode — that lives in the sibling code account, so the code",
        "account's entire contents are the hashed image and nothing un-pinned is jump-reachable.",
        "",
        "Every field here is descriptive. The seeds constraint is what proves the account's identity,",
        "derived from instruction arguments rather than from these stored values."
